// The embedded stage-announcement mp3s (PROGMEM byte arrays), the /audio
// route and its handler were taken out to reclaim flash and simplify
// current work. They return once a microSD card module is wired in (before
// that, confirm a free GPIO for its CS line). The clips stay in web/audio/
// and scripts/embed_audio.py stays in the repo; do NOT re-embed until then.
// To reinstate the old flash-embedded approach, see handleAudioFile() and
